                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593639_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "咩嗯，我记得，那是，\n我独自在星海旅行的时候。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593639_content",
                "value": "咩嗯，我记得，那是，\n我独自在星海旅行的时候。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163593639
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593640_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "那时，我一直在追踪、\n某种咩有见过的植物，",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593640_content",
                "value": "那时，我一直在追踪、\n某种咩有见过的植物，"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163593640
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593641_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "倒不是用来做玩偶的灵感，\n而是那种植物的颜色非常特别，\n可以用来制作玩偶眼睛的染料。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593641_content",
                "value": "倒不是用来做玩偶的灵感，\n而是那种植物的颜色非常特别，\n可以用来制作玩偶眼睛的染料。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163593641
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593642_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "不过不知道为什咩，\n每次来到那些星屿，\n上面几乎所有东西，都被人挖光了！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593642_content",
                "value": "不过不知道为什咩，\n每次来到那些星屿，\n上面几乎所有东西，都被人挖光了！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163593642
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593643_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "一连去了好几个星屿，都是这样。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593643_content",
                "value": "一连去了好几个星屿，都是这样。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163593643
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593644_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "就在一筹莫展的时候，\n我找到了一种特殊的星屿……\n咩嗯，就是这里。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593644_content",
                "value": "就在一筹莫展的时候，\n我找到了一种特殊的星屿……\n咩嗯，就是这里。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3163593644
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593645_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "这种偶尔随着星潮产生的星屿，\n似乎总有很多这样的植物，\n可是，我没有维持这个星屿诞生的露珠。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593645_content",
                "value": "这种偶尔随着星潮产生的星屿，\n似乎总有很多这样的植物，\n可是，我没有维持这个星屿诞生的露珠。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
