                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593653_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "可惜，这段回忆……\n不是我创作玩偶的原因。{短暂停}\n咩欸，好像还是找不到玩偶的线索。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593653_content",
                "value": "可惜，这段回忆……\n不是我创作玩偶的原因。{短暂停}\n咩欸，好像还是找不到玩偶的线索。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
