                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593654_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "不过，既然都过来了，\n不如在这里，拍摄一些照片。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106902_3163593654_content",
                "value": "不过，既然都过来了，\n不如在这里，拍摄一些照片。"
